        "text_EcyYmC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A typical fly shop sells a hundred patterns. A typical trout day asks for three or four of them. The other 96 sit in a drawer.</p><p>We built this box around the trout you'll actually fish for. We stripped away the clutter to curate a specific selection of patterns that cover the absolute most of trout feeding behavior. No guesswork. No filler. Just the confidence that you have exactly what you need.</p>"
          }
