        "text_dbQr9A": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every box ships with a waterproof field card that walks you through the decision in two minutes: what to look for at the water, which fly to tie on, and how to use it. The full field guide on the site goes deeper.</p><ul><li><strong>Match the Hatch:</strong> Identify if trout are feeding on nymphs, streamers, or dry flies.</li><li><strong>Fly Presentation:</strong> Techniques for fishing different fly types in varying water conditions.</li><li><strong>Seasonal Timing:</strong> Know what works from spring runoff to low-water autumn.</li></ul>",
